# Generated PDF briefs. Nothing reads them back - the Telegram message is built
# from the item and the dashboard reads data/*.json - so they are not kept in
# the repository or the checkout. A run writes them to a scratch directory
# (src/pdf_generator.default_output_dir); these patterns cover a local run that
# points DIGEST_REPORTS_DIR back here.
*.pdf
reports/
.test-pdfs/

